      "summary_en": "Hwei envisions a series of disasters, allowing him to paint a devastating blow. This ability replaces Hwei's abilities with damaging abilities: Devastating Fire, Severing Bolt, and Molten Fissure.",
      "summary_zh": "彗将眼中所见的灾难逐一描绘，造成可怕的破坏力。 这个技能会用这些伤害型技能替换掉彗的技能：没骨火、攒聚雷、连皴山。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": []
